# Orchestration-meta repo: track ONLY the orchestrator system files.
# Everything else in ~/code (project repos, media, env files) is ignored.
*
!.gitignore
!AGENTS.md
!CLAUDE.md
!docs/
!docs/**
!_bmad-output/
!_bmad-output/**
!.pi/
!.pi/extensions/
!.pi/extensions/**
!README.md
!managed-repos.txt
!bin/
!bin/**
!test/
!test/**
# Orchestration skills: LOCAL-ONLY canonical content (untracked 2026-09-10).
# Git-tracked copies in worktrees sat at a different realpath than the global
# ~/.pi/agent/skills symlinks pointing back at this root tree -> pi reported
# gds-*/bmad-* collisions in every worktree (project copy silently shadows
# canonical; drift risk). The root keeps the files on disk as the canonical
# source; worktrees bootstrap-symlink .agents/skills from the repo root —
# see docs/playbook-annex.md 'Dispatch — worktree bootstrap'.
/.agents/
# Live ledger state stays local: binary DB + WAL files, and SQL dump backups.
_bmad-output/orchestrator.db*
_bmad-output/backups/

# Night-watchman heartbeat log (runtime noise, never commit)
_bmad-output/watchman.log

# Python bytecode cache (gen-role-blocks test imports)
bin/__pycache__/
test/__pycache__/

# Transient perkins compute caches / bake outputs — never commit
**/.scratch-cache/
**/osm-cache/
**/.scratch-bake/

# --- Orchestration repo policy (user ruling 2026-09-16): the orchestrator
# repo is PROJECT-AGNOSTIC. Project artifacts belong in their project repos.
# The orchestrator keeps only orchestration state: briefings, journals,
# memory, field-notes, the ledger, canon docs.
# Project round dirs (Perkins verdict working dirs per repo/job):
_bmad-output/perkins/
# Project implementation artifacts (exports, evidence, project docs) —
# belong in their owning repos:
_bmad-output/implementation-artifacts/
# Project research/planning artifacts:
_bmad-output/planning-artifacts/
# Project no-PR evidence archives:
_bmad-output/no-pr-evidence/
# Godot machine churn + heavy media anywhere under _bmad-output (local-only):
_bmad-output/**/*.ctex
_bmad-output/**/*.md5
_bmad-output/**/*.import
_bmad-output/**/*.uid
_bmad-output/**/.godot/
_bmad-output/**/*.png
_bmad-output/**/*.jpg
_bmad-output/**/*.mov
_bmad-output/**/*.mp4
_bmad-output/**/*.blend
_bmad-output/**/*.wav
_bmad-output/**/*.glb
_bmad-output/**/*.patch
_bmad-output/**/*.tar.gz
